<title>FINLAND: Finnish IVO H1 op profit rises, outlook.</title>
<headline>Finnish IVO H1 op profit rises, outlook.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-owned power group Imatran Voima Oy said in a statement on Thursday operating profit rose 31 percent in the first half and that the outlook for the rest of the year was favourable.</p>
</text>
